            "gap": "Company and studied activity documented through two complementary sources: the issuer's July 30, 2024 press release describes CCC Intelligent Solutions Inc. as a subsidiary of CCC Intelligent Solutions Holdings Inc. (NASDAQ: CCCS), a cloud platform for the P&C insurance economy whose IX Cloud connects more than 35,000 businesses (issuer self-description with unverifiable marketing characterizations); an independent trade publication (Collision Repair Mag, Nov. 13, 2026) reports the GTCR/Elliott-led take-private at US$7.75/share (~US$6.1B enterprise value) with US$2.85B borrowing, an S&P B-minus assessment of the acquisition entity, and Q3-2026 filed figures (~96% subscription revenue share, US$294.1M revenue, US$30.2M net income, ~US$1.28B debt).",
